OL,3,GNEWSALib Dem leader backs Cleveland
OL,4,APolice funding calls
OL,5,
OL,6,FLiberal Democrat leader Sir Ed Davey
OL,7,Fsays the government should give
OL,8,FCleveland Police #20m extra a year so
OL,9,Fit can employ hundreds more officers to
OL,10,Ftackle the highest crime rate in
OL,11,FEngland.
OL,13,FThe force's Chief Constable and Police
OL,14,Fand Crime Commissioner (PCC) have asked
OL,15,Fthe home secretary for extra funding
OL,16,Fafter the deaths of two police officers
OL,17,Fin a crash on the A66 near
OL,18,FMiddlesbrough. Five young men also
OL,19,Fdied.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
