OL,3,GNEWSALib Dem leader backs Cleveland
OL,4,APolice funding calls
OL,5,
OL,6,FSpeaking ahead of his party's
OL,7,Fconference, Sir Ed backed their funding
OL,8,Fcalls, adding: "When you look at the
OL,9,Fcrime figures you wonder why government
OL,10,Fhasn't acted before."
OL,12,FThe government has given the force an
OL,13,Fextra #2m to tackle organised crime and
OL,14,Fsays its budget is rising.
